# Harmat — a drizzle-like query builder for Kex.
#
# Declare tables once (table-first schema DSL generating row records),
# build typed queries that collapse to static text at compile time,
# run them through one ODBC boundary. Nullable columns are Optional
# and only spell IS NULL; `= NULL` is inexpressible.
module Harmat do
  export Harmat.Schema
  export Harmat.Query
end
